{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/de9ff004994eedefbc01c72404218b5e.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/156161a1f14573d106ff0e4166cb721c.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/156161a1f14573d106ff0e4166cb721c.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/156161a1f14573d106ff0e4166cb721c.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combination RTS and base builder with a brand new kind of enemy. Boss-like and ever evolving, the Calyx are a group of powerful plant-aliens that, left unchecked, quickly spread to control swathes of the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/b67892572ce71c62a7fbf53281d4e9d6.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/c8aafa06b056f52f1d9427830355061c.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/c8aafa06b056f52f1d9427830355061c.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/c8aafa06b056f52f1d9427830355061c.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only remaining occupant of an Avaris Corporation deep-space mining vessel, you\u2019ve arrived in orbit around a barren-looking planet. While you\u2019re trying to get over being frozen for more than a century, you\u2019re dropped to the surface as the ship\u2019s AI outlines your Ore mining targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a power network, set up Harvesters and refine Ore before sending it to orbit for Credits. Build walls and turrets to protect your base. Deploy tanks and artillery to push the Calyx back before it gets too strong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your base\u2019s energy requirements carefully to avoid vital defences being down on power. Secure rare deposits and unlock new technologies to improve your mining and military capacity. Discover new and dangerous Calyx variants as you try to gain control of the planet and return home!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/f2f4d1b67e30a12a1453a8c100e1f31d.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/6fd0d747f2259ee572caf8a6f5276861.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/6fd0d747f2259ee572caf8a6f5276861.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/6fd0d747f2259ee572caf8a6f5276861.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you establish a strong defence, or attack the Calyx before it spreads too far? Dig in and build a massive force, or adopt a mobile and nimble strategy? There are many ways to defeat the different varieties of Calyx. Start your base wherever you like, experiment and develop your styles of play, and learn to cope with different scenarios.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/80462f38cfd4e2cced3fe55d182fc074.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts on the Calyx Demo to help shape future development. Please jump into the Discussion Forum, or join our Discord and let us know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/cfc223c3f1d1c5bf7260e23f9bb24a4b.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/cfc223c3f1d1c5bf7260e23f9bb24a4b.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/cfc223c3f1d1c5bf7260e23f9bb24a4b.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211850?t=1763646468","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/0b4662ade67f910f7278bdf87effdf720458ceb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763646468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/d7e718faa7bdb9a170a0b841e166b7add9c509f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763646468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/d7e718faa7bdb9a170a0b841e166b7add9c509f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763646468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3400850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/de9ff004994eedefbc01c72404218b5e.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/156161a1f14573d106ff0e4166cb721c.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/156161a1f14573d106ff0e4166cb721c.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/156161a1f14573d106ff0e4166cb721c.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combination RTS and base builder with a brand new kind of enemy. Boss-like and ever evolving, the Calyx are a group of powerful plant-aliens that, left unchecked, quickly spread to control swathes of the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/b67892572ce71c62a7fbf53281d4e9d6.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/c8aafa06b056f52f1d9427830355061c.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/c8aafa06b056f52f1d9427830355061c.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/c8aafa06b056f52f1d9427830355061c.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only remaining occupant of an Avaris Corporation deep-space mining vessel, you\u2019ve arrived in orbit around a barren-looking planet. While you\u2019re trying to get over being frozen for more than a century, you\u2019re dropped to the surface as the ship\u2019s AI outlines your Ore mining targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a power network, set up Harvesters and refine Ore before sending it to orbit for Credits. Build walls and turrets to protect your base. Deploy tanks and artillery to push the Calyx back before it gets too strong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your base\u2019s energy requirements carefully to avoid vital defences being down on power. Secure rare deposits and unlock new technologies to improve your mining and military capacity. Discover new and dangerous Calyx variants as you try to gain control of the planet and return home!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/f2f4d1b67e30a12a1453a8c100e1f31d.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/6fd0d747f2259ee572caf8a6f5276861.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/6fd0d747f2259ee572caf8a6f5276861.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/6fd0d747f2259ee572caf8a6f5276861.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you establish a strong defence, or attack the Calyx before it spreads too far? Dig in and build a massive force, or adopt a mobile and nimble strategy? There are many ways to defeat the different varieties of Calyx. Start your base wherever you like, experiment and develop your styles of play, and learn to cope with different scenarios.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/80462f38cfd4e2cced3fe55d182fc074.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts on the Calyx Demo to help shape future development. Please jump into the Discussion Forum, or join our Discord and let us know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/cfc223c3f1d1c5bf7260e23f9bb24a4b.poster.avif?t=1763646468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/cfc223c3f1d1c5bf7260e23f9bb24a4b.webm?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/extras/cfc223c3f1d1c5bf7260e23f9bb24a4b.mp4?t=1763646468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio 568"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211850/header.jpg?t=1763646468","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Calyx is copyright Studio 568 Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul